        {
          "id": "41-hordequest-find-1",
          "order": 1,
          "speaker": "classmate",
          "speakerName": "同學",
          "indigenousText": "ina, harem kana wari, man kaduwan na wadadiyan duwa kanta ruma’?",
          "chineseText": "媽媽，今天家裡為何來了這麼多親友呢？",
