          "id": "41-hordequest-outside-3",
          "order": 3,
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "speakerName": "主角",
          "indigenousText": "kasahasahar nu kinger ta, karuwa ku kurelrang kanmu?",
          "chineseText": "聽起來很好玩！我可以跟你們去嗎？",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/65751/919132.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/boy-1.png",
          "background": "1-1.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "41-hordequest-outside-4",
          "order": 4,
          "speaker": "sibling",
          "speakerName": "哥哥",
          "indigenousText": "kiwmalri diya i taina nu kemadu!",
          "chineseText": "你先問媽媽吧！",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/65751/919133.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/boy-2.png",
          "background": "1-2.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "41-hordequest-outside-5",
          "order": 5,
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "speakerName": "主角",
          "indigenousText": "ina, karuwa ku kurelrang kana iva yawa i dinanuman?",
          "chineseText": "媽媽，我可以跟哥哥一起去溪邊嗎？",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/65751/919134.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/boy-1.png",
